<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Saflife cautions on JCI statement.</title>
<headline>Saflife cautions on JCI statement.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Black empowerment firm Saflife, which  bought mining house JCI Ltd earlier this year, on Friday referred  shareholders to JCI's announcement on its planned purchase of a 26.8  percent stake in Lonrho plc.</p>
<p>The mining house said earlier it planned to issue a circular to shareholders  relating to its planned acquisition of a 26.8 percent interest in  Lonrho plc.</p>
<p>Saflife advised its shareholders and optionholders to continue exercising  caution in their share and option dealings until further notice.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
